This[ particular] skirt is from their[ ']Icelandic Summer' collection, which[ person]ifies pastels and gorgeous muted tones. Unfortunately,[ it]'s not available on their site anymore, but there are[ plenty more] prints[ to choose] from; each[ one] bolder than[ the] last.[ As it's] all shipped directly from Aus,[ you may end up] sending a[ bit] more on shipping fees to[ the] UK, but I['d] say[ it's totally] worth it: a.) for the quality & b.) because who else is crazy enough to spend that much on shipping?![ You] can[ rest] assured that[ you'll be the] only psychedelic princess rocking these prints at the festival.
