> [Tom] Coolen has coached a[ lot] of teams in his 58 years.
His career has[ sp]anned seven countries and 25 years. He�[�]s spent thousands of hours in rinks with teenagers in[ the] Quebec Major Junior Hockey League, to grizzled pros in Europe.
